<reference id="release-notes">
  <title>Release Notes: Version 1.2</title>
  <refbody>
    <section id="new-features">
      <title>New features</title>
      <ul><li>Added sensitive-data detection policies.</li><li>Added metadata-only security logging.</li><li>Added API response identifiers.</li></ul>
    </section>
    <section id="improvements">
      <title>Improvements</title>
      <ul><li>Improved gateway configuration validation.</li><li>Improved error messages for invalid API requests.</li></ul>
    </section>
    <section id="breaking-changes">
      <title>Breaking changes</title>
      <p>None.</p>
    </section>
  </refbody>
</reference>
